# Product Branch Cleanup Plan

**Branches are separate forever:** `product` is **not** merged into `main`/`master`. Portfolio demo stays on `main`; sellable v2 stays on `product`. Shared fixes use **cherry-pick**, not whole-branch merges.

**Current layout (transition):** v1 Mongo + `models/product/`, `routes/product/`, `tests/product/` coexist until cleanup.

**Target layout (product branch):** single structure — `models/stock.py`, `routes/stock.py`, `tests/test_stock_api.py` — no `product/` subfolders, no v1 tea/auth/mongo.

See `product-folder-layout.mdc` for transition rules; **this file supersedes it after cleanup**.

---

## Phases

```text
Phase 0  Prerequisites (P1-10 stock API on router_registry)
Phase 1  Delete v1 inventory + v1 auth (after P1-10)
Phase 2  Delete v1 orders + mongo_legacy (after P3 PG orders)
Phase 3  Flatten product/ subfolders, tests, infra, rules, frontend
```

